---
usecase-beta
direction LR
actor Operator("Release coordinator") <<primary>>
systemBoundary Service[Publication service]
  Publish("Publish prepared documents") <<business action>>
  Validate("Validate request")
end
classDef delivery stroke:#2563EB,color:#1D4ED8,stroke-width:2.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 3 2,opacity:0.8
Operator request@-- "requests" --> Publish
Publish ..> : include Validate
class request delivery
style request color:#0F766E
note for Publish "Approval required before delivery"
